# Ensure browsers requesting ANY /Indium/paiver/.private/ path are redirected
# before the shared host can generate its account-path-disclosing 403 page.
# The server-side Require all denied rule MUST remain for defense in depth
# if mod_alias redirect handling is unavailable or bypassed.
RedirectMatch 302 "^/Indium/paiver/\\.private(?:/.*)?$" "https://paige-lighthouse.50webs.org/Indium/paiver/"
Require all denied
ErrorDocument 403 https://paige-lighthouse.50webs.org/Indium/paiver/
